    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D Hack-and-Slash Action RPG with rogue-lite elements. Play as Zaf along with a variety of other characters to stop Altemis, a bored goddess from destroying the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside Altemis' tower are ever changing rooms, all with different enemies and use it to their advantage. Choose between 11 different characters with different abilities along with 2 characters to assist you in your fight to the top. Use your strengths, skills, and wits, equipped with Falucites to enhance your abilities and cast strong magic, to climb up Altemis' ever changing tower. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D Hack-and-Slash Action RPG with rogue-lite elements. Play as Zaf along with a variety of other characters to stop Altemis, a bored goddess from destroying the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside Altemis' tower are ever changing rooms, all with different enemies and use it to their advantage. Choose between 11 different characters with different abilities along with 2 characters to assist you in your fight to the top. Use your strengths, skills, and wits, equipped with Falucites to enhance your abilities and cast strong magic, to climb up Altemis' ever changing tower. </p>",
